              { text: 'Does digestive discomfort tend to happen with specific food groups?', opts: ['Yes, identifiable','Sometimes','Not clearly'] },
              { text: 'How often do you eat within an hour of waking?', opts: ['Often','Sometimes','Rarely'] },
